{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","科丝蒂"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名能够横贯战场制造伤害的法师，并且能为友军提供输出增益。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","研究开始，我准备好了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","This is for research."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","很好，每一次进步都会记录在案。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Excellent. I'll track every step of progress."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","来吧！知识的浪潮！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","My waves of knowledge will crush you!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","实验失败……下一次，一定……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","The results were unsatisfactory."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","得到了足以载入论文的成果。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","These results were satisfactory."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","研究什么时候开始？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","你曾经想过，为什么抛弃的东西会漂浮在空中吗？这是我第32篇论文的题目，论漂浮术的魔力构成。欢迎品鉴。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯？找我有事吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","便于行动的服装是田野调查的第一步。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_i18n/jp","動きやすい服を身につけることが、野外調査の第一歩ですよ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/jp","stt"],["/resonating_hall_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Lightweight clothing is optimal for conducting fieldwork."],["/resonating_hall_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我能感受到魔力的流动……这太珍贵了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嗯……或许它能推动我的新研究？"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","渊智之蓝"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","沉静的流水终能汇入大海，而她是最纯粹的涓滴。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","问星之途"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","她走在路上，好奇心是头顶盛放的星光。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“阴霾散尽现群星”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是个适合写论文的天气！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","接下来的论文题目……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","适合写论文时喝！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我喜欢蓝色的挂缎！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","想和梅林一起过节……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，到处都是灯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我做了魔法焰火！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/6/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里很舒服，适合读书"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/6/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","要是使用食物放大魔药……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/7/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","等我写完这篇论文……"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂已蝉联两届莱希拉姆魔法比赛冠军，每年赛后，她都会友善地邀请对手一同进餐，但都被对手果断拒绝。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂喜爱品茶，但口味独特，会在每杯茶水中加入5~7块方糖。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","甜品店“阿诺德悬岸的黎明”的最新糕点因为甜度太高，无人问津，只有科丝蒂是这家店的忠实食客。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂的借书卡上，超过80%的书名都提到了“梅林”或“魔法”，还有少部分书籍涉及心理学及人际关系管理。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂的学习笔记十分规整漂亮，每逢考试季，都有不少学生向她高价购入笔记抄写本。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","“她今天拿着一本画满符文的笔记问我法阵仪式的优化方法。天哪，第一名问我这种中等生真的好吗？”——法师希拉德"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂喜爱思想与逻辑碰撞交锋的知识较量，不过愿意陪她进行头脑风暴的友伴数量有限，每当这时，她就会转而投向书籍的海洋。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂3岁时总喜欢把玩家中陶土制成的茶具，直至家人发现茶具中的水源源不绝，怎么倒都倒不空，才察觉她的水系魔法天赋。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","科丝蒂梦想有一只“仓鼠使魔”——和传说的梅林一样。但她的召唤术往往只能唤出水元素。虽然迄今已经失败了113次，她仍未气馁。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","当科丝蒂问出“为什么”时，说明一个新的研究课题即将诞生。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","我每天都会抽时间去湖边看看小蓝。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411140.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","水的形态，总是在流转。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411150.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","梅林大人，我把我的魔法怀表改造了一下，现在它不仅可以接受简单的短讯，还可以在不使用魔力的情况下触发时间提醒！"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411090.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","梅林大人，经历了这次圣古堂事件，我才明白，宫廷魔法师这个职位所代表的责任与意义。"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411140.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，科丝蒂小姐应该是正式经受过培训的魔法师吧？\n咒语和研究方法看起来都很专业。"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411010.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 科丝蒂 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","最近的天气好干燥，我的绒毛都炸开成一团了……"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411070.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","致谢……嗯，感谢梅林大人的指引……"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411080.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","按照我设想的原理，火焰其实也可以流动吧？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415010.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂 & 米瑞尔"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","真是个适合写论文的天气！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415046.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","适合写论文时喝！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415047.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","我喜欢蓝色的挂缎！"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415347.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","想和梅林一起过节……"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415348.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","梅林的著作《实用魔法集录》里居然真的介绍了777种实用的术式……真不愧是最伟大的魔法师！"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415483.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂 & 迪尔格雷"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","哇，到处都是灯！"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415515.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","我做了魔法焰火！"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415516.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","迪尔格雷先生，我最近重读《实用魔法集录》时，发现梅林大人曾提过一个有趣的观点——"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415740.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂 & 迪尔格雷"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","这里很舒服，适合读书"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415757.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","等我写完这篇论文……"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415758.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","科丝蒂"]]}